{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2023-05-23 11:23:00', 'title': 'SYNOPSYS NAMED A LEADER IN THE 2023 GARTNER® MAGIC QUADRANT™ FOR APPLICATION SECURITY TESTING FOR SEVENTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'SYNOPSYS PLACED HIGHEST IN EXECUTION ABILITY AND FURTHEST IN COMPLETENESS OF VISION FIVE YEARS IN A ROW MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF. , MAY 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SYNOPSYS, INC. (NASDAQ:\xa0SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT\xa0HAS BEEN\xa0NAMED BY GARTNER, INC.\xa0AS A LEADER IN THE "MAGIC QUADRANT™\xa0FOR APPLICATION SECURITY TESTING" FOR THE SEVENTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR.1 IN THE\xa0REPORT, GARTNER\xa0EVALUATED 12 APPLICATION SECURITY TESTING VENDORS BASED ON THEIR COMPLETENESS OF VISION AND ABILITY TO EXECUTE.'}